    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Born Lewis, a small-time street ganger with nothing to lose, Wrecker was Embraced by Akawa in 1968 for the muscle he could provide the fledgling Blood Brothers. Cocky, violent, and none too bright, he has little real influence in the gang, but three decades of survival in Milwaukee's constant Anarch warfare have earned him Akawa's protection and a place at his sire's side. He rides a black motorcycle with flames on the tank and considers himself the coolest Vampire in Milwaukee.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Talk like a mobster movie extra out of the corner of your mouth. Cocky, reckless, a little stupid, and prone to snide remarks that get you into trouble you can usually brawl your way out of.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Akawa. Haven: none permanent. Disciplines as printed: Potence 3, Fortitude 2, Presence 2 (capped above to this system's 1-5 scale). Rides with the Blood Brothers.",
